    "c5": {
      "anchor": "context#list-3",
      "kind": "list",
      "label": "1. One example: NetBox's place reference",
      "excerpt": "Unchanged lines keep your comments: the ingest already merges its new Spell into",
      "text": "There should be a `version upgrade` path for spell code.\nAt the least, put a comment that it a field is `-- NEW as of <date>` or `-- APPARENTLY DELETED as of <date>` where `<date>` is when you looked",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-18T14:14:24.341Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "A field renamed",
      "offset": 133,
      "edited": "2026-11-18T14:15:23.551Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-18T14:24:04.814Z",
          "html": "<p>Both taken up:  the ingest marks a field it finds new with <code>-- NEW as of &lt;date&gt;</code> and one it can no longer find with <code>-- APPARENTLY DELETED as of &lt;date&gt;</code> (decision Q102, P53's plan).  A version upgrade path for Spell code is broader than this phase, so it's a todo, T170.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-18T14:21:17.912Z"
      }
    }
